{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-npc-p38493-ecff61bc425d1a9801d9","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"그르릉, 다시 만나서 정말 기쁘구나. 내 미래의 사도","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4235475254215598598"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-b82debda5961fa9c1ebd","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"야옹야옹 「개척」의 길에 대해…","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["10846911564756393012","1983343015796010415"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-4655c227c85dd39e020d","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"그날, 깊게 잠들어 있던 나는 어둠 속에서 {RUBY_B#무명객의 나침반}개척의 방향{RUBY_E#}을 찾았고, 그것이 인도하는 방향을 따라 {RUBY_B#상자}블랙홀{RUBY_E#}을 빠져나왔지——그렇게 해서, 이 야옹님이 디저트 형태로 부활했다는 말씀!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13739562975031068209"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-c153ececcab4a1334e0a","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"나처럼 차가운 우주를 {RUBY_B#유랑}「탐사」{RUBY_E#}하는 꼬마 녀석들이 아직 많아…. 그래서 이 야옹님은 녀석들을 위해 뭔가 해주고 싶어","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["18065246377028098831","13227584631220123910"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-2a478b1ef9e00b553ccc","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"그들이 인간과 교류하는 능력을 「이해」하고 「수립」하도록 가르치고, {RUBY_B#꼬리를 맡길 수 있는}「연결」{RUBY_E#}된 가족을 찾아서 마지막엔 행복한 삶을 살게 해주는 것, 그게 내 바람의 전부야!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["6650074558690140855","2571028377503240453"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-76a9bedb15316eabfe93","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"하지만 녀석들이 귀여운 척… 아니, 열심히 노력하는 것만으로는 부족해! 너처럼 녀석들에게 집을 마련해 줄 사람이 더 많이 필요하다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["4689663257955038815","7074387576357968846"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-2b762c079667b03aef26","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"그래서 난 네가 {RUBY_B#녀석들을 입양할 사람}사도{RUBY_E#}가 되길 바라는 거다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["11218552586261785734","6485056970292537349"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-2f1a30b45eafb3d35654","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"우리 집에 침입한 것에 대해…","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["18428189687178797983"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-d53d0d72b16c659035c3","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"무슨 소리야! 이 야옹님은 「냥키비리」라고! 이건… 정기적인 고향 방문이야!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["1644544337598386425"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-ed43375c964a58dd8c82","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"사실 내 나침반의 바늘은 계속 열차 방향을 가리키고 있었고, 한 번도 놓친 적이 없었어. 네가 꼬맹이들을 많이 입양한 걸 보고 나서야 비로소 이곳에 모습을 드러내기로 결심한 거야","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["967960618197955870"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-d8a0aeb7449ba20e226f","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"야옹야옹이 「개척」해야 할 곳은 아직 많기에 이 야옹님이 계속 이곳에 머무를 수는 없어","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5215779403497176525"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-02aa364e9f90b675c9c8","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"왜냐하면 이 야옹님은 디저트라고 해도, 에이언즈는 신비감을 유지해야 한다는 걸 아주 잘 알고 있기 때문이다냥!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13358372084172843382"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-29b242989209a7fc3dca","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"너와 「닥쳐」에 대해…","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["2226056342951182342"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-d60aee4fa1eb83537574","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"이 야옹님은 싫어!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["14656253653088442028"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-75bf8856e92615f0fda3","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"설마 이건 무슨 {RUBY_B#자기장}운명{RUBY_E#}의 인도인가?","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["8174618700770889933"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-753b84100dae1d5985db","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"준비한 포상에 대해…","speaker":"","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"choice","textHashCandidates":["14770298398864027513"],"speakerHashCandidates":[],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-16898051baf19520e4b0","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"급한 건 알겠지만 일단 진정해…. 준비하고 있어, 하고 있다고!","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["562485877061715079"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-98e8cef7c59677d6c915","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"궁금하다면 이 야옹님을 자주 알현하러 와, 아니면 내가 현령하는 곳으로 찾아와도 된다냥~","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["13993199580733820618"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-7e6374dbdfd608dddfee","entryId":"other-npc-p38493","chapterId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","text":"냥~ 알현 끝. 이 야옹님은 오늘 여기서 잠시 쉬어야겠어","speaker":"냥키비리","mission":"「냥키비리」","scene":"NPC 대사 2","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["5625673620613771114","2937835210065333607"],"speakerHashCandidates":["6059696639665507930"],"speakerUnresolved":false}],"wikiReading":{"schema":"hsr-wiki-reading.v1","missions":[{"id":"npc-p38493","title":"「냥키비리」","page":"「阿基喵利」","officialMissionIds":[]}],"occurrences":[{"id":"other-npc-p38493-ecff61bc425d1a9801d9","rowId":"other-npc-p38493-ecff61bc425d1a9801d9","missionId":"npc-p38493","mission":"「냥키비리」","sceneId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","scene":"NPC 대사 2","contextId":"wiki-context-f0ebe4b766f3c69cc6af9b62","page":"「阿基喵利」","revision":103567,"location":[0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":[],"nextIds":[],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wiki-display"},{"id":"other-npc-p38493-b82debda5961fa9c1ebd","rowId":"other-npc-p38493-b82debda5961fa9c1ebd","missionId":"npc-p38493","mission":"「냥키비리」","sceneId":"s7f3b7a5ba895ff85","scene":"NPC 대사 2","contextId":"wiki-context-8b6c0aeb65ad49f57b8c6dae","page":"「阿基喵利」","revision":103567,"location":[2,0,"option",0,0],"conditions":[],"branch":["292ab8f540e5-0"],"nextIds":["other-npc-p38493-4655c227c85dd39e020d"],"replyToIds":[],"status":"wik